      "v": "max",
      "t": "Спасибо, друг, ты спасаешь мне жизнь.",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "A litre of water, and a friend for life: Kostya and Max will be inseparable from here on. You've picked up the polite phrase for \"enjoy your meal\", which you can use at any table.",
      "gap": 0.5
